{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25745","headline":"奉和白敏中圣道和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上 · 马植","name":"奉和白敏中圣道和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舜德尧仁化犬戎，许提河陇欵皇风。\n指挥貙武皆神算，恢拓乾坤是圣功。\n四帅有征无汗马，七关虽戍已弢弓。\n天留此事还英主，不在他年在大中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马植","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}